              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye akirot ŋin ebe, “Irwan atipet bobo,” itejenuni alemario naka ŋul luitamaranio, kwape luesubitai, tetere esalete lumam itamaranio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
